  <p class="lede">Reward-based training means showing your dog what you want and rewarding it, instead of relying on fear or punishment.</p>
  <p>This section will hold step-by-step guides for everyday skills. Each guide will explain the goal, the steps, and common mistakes, in plain language.</p>
